cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the original xcape (see references)."
type: software
title: "xcaper"
version: "1.0.1"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24269592"
    description: "xcaper 1.0.0 on Zenodo; the record links to every later version"
date-released: 2026-11-16
abstract: >-
  xcaper computes convective and severe-weather parameters (CAPE, CIN, LCL, LFC,
  EL, DCAPE, lapse rates, Bunkers storm motion, storm-relative helicity, bulk
  shear, streamwise vorticity and streamwiseness, the effective inflow layer and
  effective-layer parameters, SCP, STP, ESCP, ESTP, EHI, WMAXSHEAR) for gridded
  data such as ERA5, with Fortran and numba backends and dask parallelism. It is
  a modernised and extended derivative of xcape 0.1.4.
authors:
